  "ingredients": [
    "5 tablespoons reduced-sodium soy sauce",
    "2 tablespoons rice wine vinegar",
    "1 tablespoon cornstarch",
    "2 tablespoons sesame oil, divided",
    "1 (1 pound) pork tenderloin, cut into strips",
    "1 fresh red chile pepper, chopped",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 onion, chopped",
    "1 green bell pepper, chopped",
    "1 head bok choy, leaves and stalks separated, chopped",
    "2 crowns broccoli, chopped",
    "1 teaspoon ground ginger"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8-SEDWusc_n0tfxw5q1n0Nf6ga8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-1-bec31a03d4354362af607e3d5ecb2ab5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk soy sauce, vinegar, and cornstarch together in a small bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P0E20ZgKUdK8KFiNJLDlqvSyi90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-2-dc251b028faf49a783415a541f01d493.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 1 tablespoon sesame oil in a wok over medium-high heat. Cook and stir tenderloin strips in hot oil until just browned, 2 to 4 minutes. Transfer pork to a plate and return the wok to heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H_EUti67-60T_TEx_JR8Fi7ruLk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-3-1ba966634cb14783bbffeac7a4c092d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining sesame oil to the wok; cook and stir red chile pepper and garlic in hot oil until sizzling, 15 to 30 seconds. Add onion and bell pepper; cook and stir until onion starts to soften, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QTFVlNS-JfaNp1r5Qaj8P5cMOAM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-4-f5ae0193c2e542f7b62b30c2d1e182db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir chopped bok choy stalks into onion mixture; cook and stir until stems begin to soften, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nb3W94nLxRB0E__99jaxSmg_wEM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-5-37c2d3767bd94f72834ad848e082e0a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add broccoli to the wok; cook and stir until slightly softened, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uMqPxzWZ_a5XryU3rvL9sqD7SLw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-6-37ca0a15952a47888710062f8acfe3c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241091/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add pork, chopped bok choy leaves, and soy sauce mixture; cook and stir until well-combined. Season pork mixture with ginger; cook and stir until bok choy leaves start to wilt and broccoli is tender, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DlSrdKE2C6xqOEzV2qbVYdf2xts=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241091-pork-stir-fry-DDMFS-step-8-40f82295f0d743d6bba5eb3dce642c7a.jpg"
      ],
